{"reviewId": "14755045_87tnEgiSc", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "第五次康波衰退向萧条转换时，缺乏第四次康波那种“供给硬约束＋需求强扩张”的组合，取而代之的是“供给弹性恢复（全球供给网络）＋需求趋弱（结构性去杠杆）＋货币宽松”，结果是价格在衰退末期剧烈下跌后进入长时间的通缩，而不是滞胀。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "第五次康波衰退向萧条转换的位置（大概率是2016—2020年）​，应是一个商品价格的长期低点，第五次康波衰退以来并没有出现类似第四次康波的滞胀问题，而是表现出明显的通缩特征", "range": "6096-6181", "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "14755045_87tnEgiSc", "userVid": 14755045, "topics": [], "createTime": 1773041020, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 14755045, "name": "宣竞", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eribDf5WbXhckyg2M2mb40M8BxVy6hmycicsKI8utaeYLiaNlHia20fGHzF0Pw2hsibrvZQ0k3rzHMaKjQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "仁者如射，射者正己而后发；发而不中，不怨胜己者，反求诸己而已", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-3000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 3000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 3, "likes": [{"userVid": 284700689, "name": "陈雷铭", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/iahdQicCC5VBQY3ImgLdc24t5THVPy9aKQyzPdNCuMY4BMSqLc0k3g0w/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "内需下降+输入型通胀", "reviewId": "14755045_87tnEgiSc", "commentId": "14755045_87tnEgiSc_c547403